<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Delhi to Kerala Car Transportation Charges Estimate
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors determine the car transportation charges from Delhi to Kerala?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The final price is shaped by vehicle size, distance (≈850 km via NH 19), fuel surcharge, toll and permit fees, type of carrier (enclosed vs open), insurance coverage, and applicable GST. Seasonal demand, extra handling for luxury cars, and any special packaging requirements also influence the overall Car Transportation Charges From Delhi To Kerala.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does it typically take to transport a car from Delhi to Kerala?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, a door‑to‑door car move from Delhi to Kerala takes 3‑4 days. This includes loading at the origin, transit across the Grand Trunk Road corridor, mandatory driver rest periods, and unloading at the destination. Unexpected roadwork or extreme weather can add an extra day.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory for car relocation between Delhi and Kerala, and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, Shree Ashirwad provides IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance for every vehicle. The policy covers total loss, accidental damage, theft, and natural calamities up to the declared value of the car. Optional higher‑value coverage can be added for premium or classic automobiles.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle during the Delhi‑Kerala transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All our trucks are equipped with satellite GPS devices that feed live location data to a customer portal. You can monitor the exact position of your car in real‑time, receive status updates at each major checkpoint, and get an estimated arrival time.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to book a car moving service from Delhi to Kerala?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need the vehicle’s Registration Certificate (RC), a valid insurance policy, PAN or GSTIN of the payer, a signed e‑Way bill, and a copy of your ID proof. For corporate or government transfers, additional reimbursement authorisation forms may be required.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden fees I should watch out for when hiring movers for Delhi to Kerala car transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Transparent pricing is a core promise of Shree Ashirwad. All potential charges—fuel surcharge, tolls, insurance premium, and GST—are disclosed in the quote. Hidden fees only arise if you request extra services such as overnight storage, last‑minute route changes, or special handling beyond the standard package.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the season or weather affect car transportation charges on the Delhi‑Kerala route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Monsoon periods can increase fuel consumption and may require additional protective measures for the vehicle, leading to a modest surcharge (usually 5‑7%). Conversely, off‑peak winter months often see lower demand, allowing for slight discounts. Seasonal variations are reflected in the final Car Transportation Charges From Delhi To Kerala.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
